# 🛡️ Global Risk Prediction Repository Ignore Rules

# Root Ignore everything by default (standard for this repo's architecture)
/*

# 🔓 Whitelist the major project modules
!/lending_club/
!/universal_historian/
!/Berka/
!.gitignore

# 🔴 Blacklist massive datasets (.csv, .parquet, .zip)
**/*.csv
**/*.parquet
**/*.zip
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
dataset/
behavioral_dataset.zip

# 🔴 Blacklist serialized ML artifacts (.pkl, .h5)
**/*.pkl
**/*.h5
**/models/
**/model/
**/moneyviz_surrogate/

# 🟢 Standard Python runtime ignores
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.ipynb_checkpoints/

# 🟢 Specialized Quarantine folders
**/moneyviz_surrogate/

# ⚪ Whitelist specific small documentation CSVs if necessary
!**/sample_data.csv
